{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-so-that",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 292,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "so that",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "（表示目的）为了，以便"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Speak louder "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "so that"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " everyone in the meeting room can hear you clearly."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "请你大声点，以便会议室的每个人都能清楚地听到你的讲话。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "so that 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：so that + 句子 与 in order/so as to + 动词原形 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Kitty practises playing the piano after class "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "so that"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " she can win the competition."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Kitty practises playing the piano after class "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in order/so as to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " win the competition."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "为了能赢得比赛，姬蒂下课后练习弹钢琴。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Some girls in my company hardly have supper "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "so that"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " they can lose weight."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Some girls in my company hardly have supper "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in order/so as to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " lose weight."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我公司里有些女孩为了减肥几乎不吃晚饭。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
